{
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "427",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "The documents Executor Arren provided are just the break we needed in our battle with the wretched Scarlet Crusade.  We now know their exact locations throughout Tirisfal Glades.\n\nBut the Deathguard has larger concerns.  The Lich King's army grows in number each night.  We need someone with \"initiative\" like yourself to drive the Scarlet Crusade to the grave.\n\nProve to me you are capable of serving The Dark Lady by travelling west to the tower past the Solliden Farmstead and slay 10 Scarlet Warriors.",
      "englishSHA256": "c088d9953abd29bb53de22d9de1137e5b42cc1827e051ced47de56512b3a422f"
    },
    {
      "id": "427",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "If you wish to prove your worth to The Dark Lady, slay 10 Scarlet Warriors, <class>.",
      "englishSHA256": "7062570508ec1dc7fb8f37d9f67d62e0609ba332c7a09ad1f495dffbb0e25e64"
    },
    {
      "id": "427",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Most excellent, <class>. Your skill in the art of combat is undeniable.",
      "englishSHA256": "45b98a95f05757b64179f3298e737ddef302032354c95040b24a1cbeb619fd81"
    },
    {
      "id": "431",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "Candles of Beckoning",
      "englishSHA256": "ddd6a5b024628a1290f5a24e0668757c4c17cfd03f69f9b3d66f4358ffb06f5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "431",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You grab one of the candles and place it in your pack.",
      "englishSHA256": "93daf70e0be842ab54245da40d0a3ce593899376110de1b1f82a4bafca1736a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "445",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "Delivery to Silverpine Forest",
      "englishSHA256": "e9a48f602a3ab5d3d5bb55a1cab2edf45e2b055b4c63f3cfc5357a6afe095e8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "445",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Take Apothecary Johaan's findings to Apothecary Renferrel in Silverpine Forest.",
      "englishSHA256": "9effdfb3019f53eec19584f40c4507ae93d8897b7526bf52fac492df7331b229"
    },
    {
      "id": "445",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "Time is a luxury that is not afforded to those of us under the employ of Lady Sylvanas.  Surely you know this by now.\n\nAs a member of the Royal Apothecary Society it is my duty to share my knowledge with my colleagues so that our collective efforts might one day provide The Dark Lady with the New Plague she so badly desires.\n\nTake these findings to Apothecary Renferrel who is stationed at The Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.  Follow the roads to the south from Brill.  From the Undercity go southwest.",
      "englishSHA256": "bef3d2c288541d4d193e13d899e81167ba7d4495d023edc8f283644b086561bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "445",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "What business do you have with me, <class>?",
      "englishSHA256": "ab00fc449a6f94f2c962d5721f7ca49fd26dfb99f5f9fa6f980ca79c675c3b95"
    },
    {
      "id": "445",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Ah, how good of Apothecary Johaan to send his research. With so many new developments here in Silverpine, I nearly forgot about the findings coming out of Lordaeron and Tirisfal Glades. Which reminds me, I need to get those samples off to the Necropolis soon.\n\nBut you must excuse my rambling. Extend your stay in Silverpine, <name>. We could use an able bodied <class> like you around here.",
      "englishSHA256": "2af14563bd658234c0f75fca46a369f9736f3f8195421213724f4f95bb563988"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "A New Plague",
      "englishSHA256": "b86e93de43e455ef0f3cb6fc30c078d691cadba4bd46b1845c55b93f401ba031"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Bring Johaan's Special Drink to the Captured Mountaineer.",
      "englishSHA256": "73f1bdc5ec4036a0c3633f16966cc07dc7480d3c138b1247d63f95bad61777ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "According to the Deathguard, another one of those foolish Dwarven Mountaineers has just been captured.  The Deathguard likes to use the cellar of the Gallows End Tavern as a holding cell until prisoners can be \"properly\" dealt with.\n\nWhy don't you go see how the Captured Mountaineer enjoys this special drink I made for him?  It contains a subtle hint of what The Dark Lady has planned for the rest of Azeroth.",
      "englishSHA256": "f8e27bc06c083582371844047b8d23802f7b35694506f9f613901af5c2bf120a"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Why if I had my trusted rifle you'd be as good as dead, <class>.  Just wait until the Steam Tank Brigade arrives to rescue me!",
      "englishSHA256": "c9d587e89c604229cf5cd8ee62fbe3907bfb374b278e4d6e4f8d4df85d53386c"
    },
    {
      "id": "492",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "Ah, a drink at last.  I'm sure it's no Rhapsody Malt but I'll take anything to whet the old whistle at this point.",
      "englishSHA256": "257b6ccab6266f9347355c931771f14899faa01877b73fde14934c0f1aa96b8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1471",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "The Binding",
      "englishSHA256": "dcbeedd80da9c3a245495abec7ee8029bf210f06d6ae264647c0f48cdd43f42e"
    },
    {
      "id": "1471",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Using the Runes of Summoning, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Runes of Summoning to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.",
      "englishSHA256": "b58430075e42eed3eb5b74d5fea7695fe3d41dae94f93f1402c3d17ff306265f"
    },
    {
      "id": "1471",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "Surely you have seen the circle of summoning below us? Only there will you be able to draw forth an unbound voidwalker.\n\nUsing these runes, you will be able to draw it forth, and then you must dominate it through strength of arms and magic.\n\nWhen it is subdued, it will be indentured to you. Come to me then, and I will elucidate the spell of summoning, so that it may serve you to whatever end you wish.",
      "englishSHA256": "42caf32a8b24499c81cb4952e6c85d730f9130a8a219a4712605faa56271922d"
    },
    {
      "id": "1471",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "I expect to hear of your success, <name>. Not meeting my expectations will be the least of your worries, however, should you fail.",
      "englishSHA256": "28bddd6157e816fb9bf1d959494148c75628f4cf7bb241a4123d258bfe8913e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "1471",
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You have done well, <name>. Now, I will impart to you the spell used for summoning the voidwalker.\n\nThe power that it unleashed upon you is now yours to command. Use it wisely.",
      "englishSHA256": "c2526aceb42dec5a93e56c405c5d5b8c22b51defb5c77e8be2239fd5aa96729f"
    },
    {
      "id": "1473",
      "field": "title",
      "text": "Creature of the Void",
      "englishSHA256": "f8737fc6465410630e4e835b44067e4d378b002007bea7d336081ec22a34f6f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "1473",
      "field": "objective",
      "text": "Recover Egalin's Grimoire and bring it to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.",
      "englishSHA256": "a969a9374a30e99b9ba408a2739778d6240dc20f521a3ef7a19cfa5268164ec9"
    },
    {
      "id": "1473",
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "It seems the consensus that you are ready to learn to summon a voidwalker.\n\nA being created of the chaos that lies beyond, if you summon one but cannot control it, you will be torn asunder.\n\nThe first voidwalker was summoned by Egalin, and in his grimoire is the process explained.\n\nUnfortunately, it was stolen from us by an agent of the Scarlet Crusade who has it secreted away in his base at a tower to the west. Bring it to me, and I will impart the knowledge to you.",
      "englishSHA256": "41f139f68c2b5a3808032f951795c8bb80e6d98f633368351c36968f70d6829c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1473",
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Egalin was the teacher that taught me. With hardly a look, he was able to command the voidwalker he had summoned.\n\nWhen it came my turn to try, I was overconfident. Do not trifle with the powers that you wield, <name>, they can consume even the vigilant.",
      "englishSHA256": "9e1db6775db6ceac52e0d21c8f564dbe4cda59df6251ccaa1d7d8adb2c636a06"
    }
  ],
  "response": {
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"translations\":[{\"targetLang\":\"MY\",\"translations\":[{\"detectedSourceLanguage\":\"EN\",\"text\":\"\\u1021\\u1019\\u103E\\u102F\\u1006\\u1031\\u102C\\u1004\\u103A Arren \\u1000 \\u1015\\u1031\\u1038\\u1021\\u1015\\u103A\\u1001\\u1032\\u1037\\u101E\\u1031\\u102C \\u1005\\u102C\\u101B\\u103D\\u1000\\u103A\\u1005\\u102C\\u1010\\u1019\\u103A\\u1038\\u1019\\u103B\\u102C\\u1038\\u1000 \\u1000\\u103B\\u103D\\u1014\\u103A\\u102F\\u1015\\u103A\\u1010\\u102D\\u102F\\u1037\\u104F \\u1006\\u102D\\u102F\\u1038\\u101B\\u103D\\u102C\\u1038\\u101E\\u1031\\u102C Scarlet Crusade \\u1014\\u103E\\u1004\\u1037\\u103A \\u1010\\u102D\\u102F\\u1000\\u103A\\u1015\\u103D\\u1032\\u1010\\u103D\\u1004\\u103A \\u101C\\u102D\\u102F\\u1021\\u1015\\u103A\\u1001\\u1032\\u1037\\u101E\\u100A\\u1037\\u103A \\u1021\\u1001\\u103D\\u1004\\u1037\\u103A\\u1021\\u101B\\u1031\\u1038\\u1000\\u102D\\u102F \\u1015\\u1031\\u1038\\u1001\\u1032\\u1037\\u101E\\u100A\\u103A\\u104B \\u101A\\u1001\\u102F \\u1000\\u103B\\u103D\\u1014\\u103A\\u102F\\u1015\\u103A\\u1010\\u102D\\u102F\\u1037\\u101E\\u100A\\u103A Tirisfal Glades \\u1010\\u1005\\u103A\\u101C\\u103B\\u103E\\u1031\\u102C\\u1000\\u103A\\u101C\\u102F\\u1036\\u1038\\u101B\\u103E\\u102D \\u101E\\u1030\\u1010\\u102D\\u102F\\u1037\\u104F \\u1010\\u102D\\u1000\\u103B\\u101E\\u1031\\u102C \\u1010\\u100A\\u103A\\u1014\\u1031\\u101B\\u102C\\u1019\\u103B\\u102C\\u1038\\u1000\\u102D\\u102F \\u101E\\u102D\\u101B\\u103E\\u102D\\u1011\\u102C\\u1038\\u1015\\u102B\\u1015\\u103C\\u102E\\u104B\\n\\n\\u101E\\u102D\\u102F\\u1037\\u101E\\u1031\\u102C\\u103A Deathguard \\u1019\\u103E\\u102C \\u1015\\u102D\\u102F\\u1019\\u102D\\u102F\\u1000\\u103C\\u102E\\u1038\\u1019\\u102C\\u1038\\u101E\\u1031\\u102C \\u1005\\u102D\\u102F\\u1038\\u101B\\u102D\\u1019\\u103A\\u1015\\u1030\\u1015\\u1014\\u103A\\u1019\\u103E\\u102F\\u1019\\u103B\\u102C\\u1038 \\u101B\\u103E\\u102D\\u1014\\u1031\\u101E\\u100A\\u103A\\u104B Lich King \\u104F \\u1010\\u1015\\u103A\\u1019\\u1010\\u1